Error [E0003]: a `??` fallback block needs a final value or exit
  --> tests/ui/qq_empty_block_fallback.jet:3:26
    |
  3 |     value :: maybe() ?? {}
    |                          ^
 Why: a fallback block runs its statements and then produces one value or leaves control
 Fix: add a final value or exit, such as `{ log(err); default_value }` or `{ log(err); return }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
